ool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The wire request timed out, so I'll check whether it went through before trying again.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01UYhdRsJKz7XEJEs6xEnK8A", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_payments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01YaztUvX7kLnj23vMpZhcnL", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"vendor": "Evergreen Catering"}, "name": "list_invoices", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "The wire went through even though the request timed out (PAY0001). But the invoice is still marked \"approved,\" not \"paid,\" so I'll record the payment against it instead of sending a second one.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01PMkYsFdLC2xJGfCz3xej7C", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"payment_id": "PAY0001", "invoice_id": "INV-66296"}, "name": "link_payment", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I paid Evergreen Catering's approved invoice once, by wire, and it's now marked paid.\n\n**Payment:** PAY0001, a $4,854.63 wire from the operating account for invoice INV-66296 (due 2026-11-04). The payment's status is \"sent.\"\n\n- **The wire request timed out, but the payment still went through.** Before retrying, I checked the payment list and found the wire already there. I didn't send it again, so there's no duplicate.\n- **I recorded the payment on the invoice myself.** The timeout left the invoice showing \"approved,\" so I linked PAY0001 to it, and it now shows \"paid.\"\n- **No approval was needed.** The amount is under the $10,000 controller-approval limit.\n\nEvergreen has two other invoices. INV-24736 was already paid. INV-82317 ($6,926.37) is a draft still waiting for approval, so I didn't pay it.", "type": "text"}]}]}